    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "92E18DBC67B6A80F",
      "text": "¡¿Y eso?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "92E18EBC67B6A9C2",
      "text": "¿Ya no te gusta?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "50B90C7098D3DAF0",
      "text": "Que quede claro que no es por ti, ni porque ya\\nno me guste.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "50B90F7098D3E009",
      "text": "Es solo que antes estaba tan obsesionado con\\nhacerme más fuerte... con llegar a ser como tú...\\r\\nque ya no disfrutaba de los combates.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "50B90E7098D3DE56",
      "text": "Por eso quiero tomarme un tiempo para pensar\\ny replantearme las cosas.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "50B9117098D3E36F",
      "text": "Quiero tener una relación más sana con todos...\\nCon mis compañeros y con mis Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "92E18FBC67B6AB75",
      "text": "¡Es un buen motivo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "92E188BC67B69F90",
      "text": "¡Apoyo tu decisión!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "50B9107098D3E1BC",
      "text": "Je, je. Gracias.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "50B9137098D3E6D5",
      "text": "Aparte de mi salida, no habrá cambios en la\\nplantilla del Alto Mando.\\c\\nAsí que Denis puede estar tranquilo, que no le\\ndarán la patada.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "50B9127098D3E522",
      "text": "¡Pero no te descuides, ¿eh?![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_08",
      "hash64": "50B9157098D3EA3B",
      "text": "En cuanto me sienta listo para volver a la carga,\\n¡pienso ir otra vez a por el título de Campeón![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_05",
      "hash64": "92E189BC67B6A143",
      "text": "¡Te estaré esperando!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_bb_brother_sp03_select_06",
